{
  "project_id": 21,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 9199,
  "title": "A feminist reimagining of Kenya's public transport",
  "author": "Naomi Mwaura",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/naomi_mwaura_a_feminist_reimagining_of_kenya_s_public_transport",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T09:21:42.323464Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T09:21:42.323464Z",
  "lead_time": 30.315,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "In Kenya, buses are commonly known as \"matatus.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "986B3C27CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "They're everywhere -- and I mean everywhere.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5A063FDA05",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "And they form a very crucial part of Kenyans' urban life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "149CD9F7EF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "colorfully painted buses with graffiti that depicts what is going on in Kenya and the world at large",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB4924A212",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 132,
        "text": "They're informal and affordable ways for Kenyans to get around and are used by the vast majority as the main mode of transportation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E2E8D391E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "But they have a couple of flaws.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7F0BF3904C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 28,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "drive on the wrong side of the road to avoid traffic",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DEFFF20310",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "Back in the 90s, my family was in the matatu business and ran a popular graffiti matatu called \"Gridlock'd.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "36BBF8C57A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "\"Gridlock'd\" was an American black comedy film starring the popular rapper Tupac Shakur.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "46B71E6AA2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "My uncles loved Tupac, and as a result, I can still sing along to most of his songs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C14718763B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "Seven years ago, I stepped into the family business, and I brought a twist with me -- a feminist perspective.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C5E7953F2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "And this is what informs this perspective:",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A20D69FDF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 43,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "women all over the world face sexual harassment while using public transport",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "092DB62BBC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "In Kenya, 88 percent of women have experienced harassment while using public transportation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "66800D62C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Unfortunately, we Kenyans are not alone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F0073BE06",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "In a 2014 study conducted in the US, public transportation was the second-most common place for street harassment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "09D801F5F5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 54,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "a whopping 95 percent",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "477C77A394",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "This percentage is even higher in Cairo, Egypt, where a whopping 95 percent of women have experienced harassment while using public transportation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "46E7BC5F3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 133,
        "text": "This percentage ranges all over the world, but there's not a single transport system where women do not face this type of harassment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0A6ACF5E41",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 107,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "and eventually",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "630A1A0325",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 215,
        "text": "This leads to a massive financial loss for women, more commute time as they try to avoid dangerous routes, and eventually, they drop out of a system that isn't built for them and doesn't cater to their travel needs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA6FD8A89E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 301,
        "text": "So instead of women using affordable and environmentally sustainable public transportation to work, school and social events, they use their hard-earned and saved monies on safer but much more expensive means of transportation that leaves them out of building savings to ensure financial independence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B0018BE797",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "I cringe",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FAE2641AA1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 151,
        "text": "I cringe when newspaper headlines read, \"Let's get rid of matatus,\" because millions of commuters would be stranded and thousands of youths unemployed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0603AC6436",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "They say, \"The system doesn't work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C4E6D466BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "Let's get rid of it.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F5AA607A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "But I say no.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2AD23F8C1A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "We need to put in the work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D7EED7B476",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "We have a lot to work with",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7B5125898C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "We have a lot to work with, and we need to put in the work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC73C0405B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "For the past seven years, we've worked with over 1,000+ public transport operators, 2,000 transport stakeholders and over 150 women professionals in the industry.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4C8A5D4D6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 160,
        "text": "The interventions that have yielded great impact are driven by research findings and working with public transport organizations to change the existing systems.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "003CED7F70",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "One way we are doing this is by offering trainings on how to improve commuter experience.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ACA8319AE7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 150,
        "endOffset": 179,
        "text": "totally unknown neighborhoods",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E33BDCDB53",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 180,
        "text": "For example, it used to be that buses would unexpectedly change their route either to avoid traffic or the police, and women would find themselves in totally unknown neighborhoods.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CDBBF73C0D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "But now, buses are required to display their route map, fare charts and contact details of how and whom to report any incidences.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1D3A1B7407",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "We've also been actively recruiting and shining a spotlight on women professionals working in the industry so more women can join.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9CAB83FF8C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "When more women work in the industry, they are in positions to make changes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "517CBCDF48",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 179,
        "text": "So we've created a community, and an active network of women professionals working in the Nairobi metropolitan area who meet regularly and attend professional development courses.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25BE20D456",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "Women who are joining the industry have a real voice now.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "86AC760C21",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 166,
        "text": "We have a stronger network, more and more expertise, and more money is being put into researching gender-based violence that plagues women as they go about their day.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "909AC49E62",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "So instead of getting rid of matatus, let's understand travel habits.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "67C05551BB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Let's train on how to improve commuter experience.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E6D67D072B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "Let's change behavior.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F2ED4362B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "Let's train on and adopt sexual harassment policies, and let's hire a more diverse workforce.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14D18DBF5E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "Just like myself and my family, I believe public transportation can be the preferred mode of transport and workplace for millions of Kenyans.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F194B9E785",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}